# Programs, processes, and services.
# Running this script does not start or stop anything. The functions are the sentences.
Allow changing processes

To OpenNotepad, returning nothing
    open the program "notepad.exe"

To StopNotepad, returning nothing
    the process is "notepad"
    stop the process

To StartSpooler, returning nothing
    the service is "spooler"
    start the service

To StopSpooler, returning nothing
    the service is "spooler"
    stop the service

To RestartSpooler, returning nothing
    the service is "spooler"
    restart the service

When run, returning an integer
    return 1
